{'symbol': 'ZION', 'date': '2021-12-01 10:28:00', 'title': 'VECTRA BANK RECOGNIZED AS ONE OF THE 50 MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN COLORADO', 'text': "DENVER, DEC. 1, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0VECTRA BANK\xa0HAS BEEN NAMED AN HONOREE OF THE CIVIC 50\xa0COLORADO\xa0BY\xa0CSR SOLUTIONS OF COLORADO\xa0AND POINTS OF LIGHT, THE WORLD'S LARGEST ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO VOLUNTEER SERVICE.\xa0THE AWARD RECOGNIZES VECTRA BANK AS ONE OF THE MOST COMMUNITY-MINDED COMPANIES IN COLORADO, DETERMINED BY AN INDEPENDENTLY ADMINISTERED AND SCORED SURVEY."}